---
description: Scholaris Supabase migrations, functions, permissions and data integrity
globs: "supabase/**/*,src/types/database.ts,src/features/**/*-api.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) and [SECURITY.md](../../docs/SECURITY.md).
Inspect the full migration chain before editing. Preserve RLS/column grants,
exactly one owner, current membership checks, quotas, versions and transactional
history. Use narrow authorized RPCs with fixed search paths where appropriate.

Validate inputs and lock order; reconcile retries without duplicate side effects.
Preserve private Storage references and historical attribution. Keep Google and
email secrets backend-only. Do not reset data or assume local changes are deployed
to hosted Supabase. Update the frontend database contract when SQL changes.
